{'symbol': 'BKNG', 'date': '2022-05-11 08:18:00', 'title': 'AGODA PARTNERS WITH VISA TO OFFER INTEREST-FREE CREDIT CARD INSTALMENTS ACROSS ITS PROPERTY BOOKINGS', 'text': "THIS IS PART OF THE COMPANY'S EFFORTS TO DIVERSIFY PAYMENT OPTIONS TO SUIT ALL TRAVELLER NEEDS\xa0 SINGAPORE , MAY 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GLOBAL TRAVEL PLATFORM AGODA, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS PARTNERSHIP WITH VISA, THE WORLD LEADER IN DIGITAL PAYMENTS, TO OFFER INTEREST-FREE CREDIT CARD INSTALMENTS ACROSS ITS BOOKING PLATFORM. AGODA WILL BE THE FIRST GLOBAL ONLINE TRAVEL AGENCY (OTA) TO OFFER THIS PAYMENT OPTION WITH VISA IN THE ASIA PACIFIC REGION."}